## About Me

- Solutions Architect and Technical Lead with 8+ years in software engineering.
- 5+ years operating Kubernetes and AWS environments.
- Architected healthcare systems running across 14 hospitals, serving ~1,400 users.
- Designed and operated 5 production Kubernetes clusters across 36 production nodes.
- Built unified observability across 48 production and UAT Kubernetes nodes.
- Automated GitOps and CI/CD pipelines, cutting deployment time from ~5 minutes to ~50 seconds.
- Engineered healthcare integrations using HL7, MLLP, PACS, and LIS standards.
- Hands-on with backend development, infrastructure automation, and production debugging.
- Based in Thailand; open to remote opportunities.

---

## Healthcare Platform Architecture

Microservices-based Healthcare Information System running across on-premises and hybrid-cloud Kubernetes environments:

```text
14 hospitals
├── 24 microservices
├── ~1,400 users
├── 5 production Kubernetes clusters
├── 36 production nodes
└── 99.95% SLA
```

